  "notable_quotes": [
    "Ligand bending can change framework topology: with Zn4O nodes, linear dicarboxylates give pcu MOF-5-type structures, while bent dicarboxylates yield acs.",
    "A double-bent-ligand strategy can restore kagome-lattice tolerance to bent layer-forming ligands by using a matching bent N-donor pillar.",
    "These MOFs show inverse ethane/ethylene separation behavior and also good CO2/CH4 separation performance."
